Visit us at Via dei Mercanti 27, PC 40-217 Porto Celeste, Valdoria. The studio is on the second floor, above a bookbinder. The entrance has blue tiles and a potted olive tree. Ring the bell marked Harbor Lane.

We answer the phone from 09:00 to 17:30 on working days. Write to [hello@harborlane.example](mailto:hello@harborlane.example) for general questions, or call +990 40 555 0100 if you prefer to talk.

## Before you visit

Please book a time first, so that the right consultant is there. The tram stops two minutes away, and there are bicycle racks at the front of the building. The studio is step-free from the street, and we can arrange a meeting room on the ground floor on request.

## Working with us

If you are not sure which service you need, describe the problem in a few sentences. We reply within two working days with a short note about who could help and what a first step would look like.
